        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」を、常にこの項目を開くアプリケーションに設定できませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” expands to far more than its size, which is typical of a damaged or malicious archive, so it wasn’t extracted." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” expands to far more than its size, which is typical of a damaged or malicious archive, so it wasn’t extracted."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」は展開すると元の大きさをはるかに超えます。壊れた書庫や悪意のある書庫に見られる特徴のため、展開しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has the same word and neither requires a phrase, so a book with that word is taken by both and not decided — unless an excluded phrase keeps it out of one." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%@” has the same word and neither requires a phrase, so a book with that word is taken by both and not decided — unless an excluded phrase keeps it out of one."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」にも同じ語があり、どちらも先頭の語句を必須にしていないので、その語を含む本は両方に当たって決まりません(例外の語句で片方から外れる本を除く)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
