            "value" : "「%1$@」は展開すると %2$@ を超えるため、展開しませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Close Book” closes this tab (the window too, if it is the only tab). “Return to Home” keeps the window open." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Close Book” closes this tab (the window too, if it is the only tab). “Return to Home” keeps the window open."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「本を閉じる」はこのタブを閉じます(タブが1枚だけならウインドウごと閉じます)。「ホームへ戻る」はウインドウを残します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Her Hypnosis Revenge” joins the run of “Her Hypnosis 2, 3, 4”. It acts only where the script changes and what follows is not hiragana — hiragana carries on the same word — and only to join a run that volumes already built, never to start one" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Her Hypnosis Revenge” joins the run of “Her Hypnosis 2, 3, 4”. It acts only where the script changes and what follows is not hiragana — hiragana carries on the same word — and only to join a run that volumes already built, never to start one"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「彼女催眠2・3・4」の並びに「彼女催眠リベンジ」を入れます。効くのは文字の種類が変わり、続きがひらがなでないとき(ひらがなが続くのは語の途中)で、しかも巻でまとまった組へ入れるときだけです。新しい組を作るのには使いません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Save page thumbnails to disk” is off, but the thumbnail folder still contains files. Turning the setting off should delete them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Save page thumbnails to disk” is off, but the thumbnail folder still contains files. Turning the setting off should delete them."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「ページのサムネイルをディスクに保存する」がオフなのに、サムネイルのフォルダにファイルが残っています。本来はオフにした時点で削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“X 6 front half” and “X 6 back half” form their own run named “X 6”. When that name is the series name plus something that reads as a volume, the run joins the series instead of standing beside it" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“X 6 front half” and “X 6 back half” form their own run named “X 6”. When that name is the series name plus something that reads as a volume, the run joins the series instead of standing beside it"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「X 6巻 前編」「X 6巻 後編」は、それだけで「X 6巻」という並びを作ります。その名前が「シリーズ名 + 巻として読めるもの」のときは、別のシリーズにせず、元のシリーズへ入れます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“X eve A”, “X eve A 3” and “X eve A 4” form their own run named “X eve A”, because they carry numbers of their own. When this is on, such a run joins the series “X” too — but only when “X” is itself a run of numbered volumes — and each book keeps its subtitle in the volume (“eve A 3”) so it does not clash with the series’ own volume 3. Compilations are left to the compilation policy" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“X eve A”, “X eve A 3” and “X eve A 4” form their own run named “X eve A”, because they carry numbers of their own. When this is on, such a run joins the series “X” too — but only when “X” is itself a run of numbered volumes — and each book keeps its subtitle in the volume (“eve A 3”) so it does not clash with the series’ own volume 3. Compilations are left to the compilation policy"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「X eve A」「X eve A 3」「X eve A 4」は自前の番号を持つので、「X eve A」という別の組になります。入にすると、そうした組もシリーズ「X」に入れます(「X」そのものが番号の並んだ組のときだけ)。巻は副題ごと(「eve A 3」)にして、本編の 3 巻と重ならないようにします。総集編は、総集編の方針に従います"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“X ex”, “X SP”" : {
