    "%lld books were registered with only the author, title, series and volume, so their genre, event, source work and info are empty. Fill only the empty fields from the file names (the registered values stay locked), or unlock them and parse and extract them again from the file names (the locked values are thrown away)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld books were registered with only the author, title, series and volume, so their genre, event, source work and info are empty. Fill only the empty fields from the file names (the registered values stay locked), or unlock them and parse and extract them again from the file names (the locked values are thrown away)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
