    },
    "A book in the series “X” whose title goes on straight after “X” with no separator gets the rest of the title as its volume (“Xなつまつり”). When the rest starts with one of the particles in the list (“Xの安息”), it is the rest of a word, and the volume is left empty" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book in the series “X” whose title goes on straight after “X” with no separator gets the rest of the title as its volume (“Xなつまつり”). When the rest starts with one of the particles in the list (“Xの安息”), it is the rest of a word, and the volume is left empty"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シリーズ「X」の本で、題名が「X」のあとに区切りなしで続くときは、残りを巻数(表示)にします(「Xなつまつり」)。残りが一覧の助詞で始まるとき(「Xの安息」)は語の続きなので、巻数(表示)を空にします"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book on its own is given volume 1, or is not" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book on its own is given volume 1, or is not"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シリーズに 1 冊しかない本の巻数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book put in the main series falls back to “X Compilation” when no main series was found — with one compilation enough to make it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book put in the main series falls back to “X Compilation” when no main series was found — with one compilation enough to make it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「本編のシリーズに入れる」を選んでも、本編のシリーズが見つからない本は「X 総集編」になります(そのときは 1 冊でもシリーズにします)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book that carries a word such as “after” or “epilogue” where the others carry a number. The wording in the name is kept as the volume you see, and it is sorted right after the last numbered volume of the series." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book that carries a word such as “after” or “epilogue” where the others carry a number. The wording in the name is kept as the volume you see, and it is sorted right after the last numbered volume of the series."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ほかの本が番号を持つ所に、「アフター」「後日談」のような語が書いてある本です。名前に書いてある表記をそのまま巻数(表示用)にして、並べる数はシリーズの最後の巻の次にします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book that carries one of these words instead of a number is placed right after the last numbered volume of its series" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book that carries one of these words instead of a number is placed right after the last numbered volume of its series"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "番号の代わりにこの語が書いてある本を、そのシリーズの最後の巻のすぐ後ろに置きます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book that follows the story has no volume number" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book that follows the story has no volume number"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本編の後の話に巻数が付かない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book whose folders or name contain any one of these. Upper and lower case, and full and half width, are not told apart. With no word, this rule set is never chosen automatically." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A book whose folders or name contain any one of these. Upper and lower case, and full and half width, are not told apart. With no word, this rule set is never chosen automatically."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダか名前に、どれか 1 つを含む本に当てます。大文字と小文字、全角と半角は区別しません。語が無ければ、このルールセットは自動では選ばれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A book whose title holds one of these joins no series. The bundled list is empty" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
