    "A rule set that requires a phrase comes before one that ① alone takes. So when two rule sets share a word and one of them requires “(”, books whose names start with “(” go to that one and the rest to the other." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A rule set that requires a phrase comes before one that ① alone takes. So when two rule sets share a word and one of them requires “(”, books whose names start with “(” go to that one and the rest to the other."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先頭の語句を必須にしたルールセットは、① だけで当たるルールセットより優先されます。同じ語を持つ 2 つのルールセットの片方で「(」を必須にすれば、「(」で始まる本はそちら、それ以外の本はもう片方で読みます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
