    },
    "At launch, lists the books in your collections whose file is gone even though the volume it was on is connected, and asks whether to remove them. Books on a volume you have disconnected are never listed, and nothing is removed until you choose Remove. A collection whose every book is gone is removed along with them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "At launch, lists the books in your collections whose file is gone even though the volume it was on is connected, and asks whether to remove them. Books on a volume you have disconnected are never listed, and nothing is removed until you choose Remove. A collection whose every book is gone is removed along with them."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動したときに、ボリュームは接続されているのに実体が無くなっている本をコレクションの中から探し、削除するかどうかを尋ねます。取り外しているボリュームにある本は対象になりません。「削除」を押すまで何も削除されません。中の本が全部なくなるコレクションは、コレクションごと削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
