    "Dropped from the title before books are compared. Books with the same title once it is dropped are the same work in another edition" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dropped from the title before books are compared. Books with the same title once it is dropped are the same work in another edition"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比べるときはタイトルから外します。外して同じタイトルになる本は、同じ作品のバージョン違いです"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dropped from the title before books are compared. The contents are the same; only the form it was published in differs" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dropped from the title before books are compared. The contents are the same; only the form it was published in differs"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比べるときはタイトルから外します。中身は同じで、発行の形(媒体・装丁)だけが違います"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duplicate" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Duplicate"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "複製"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each action can have several triggers. Drag gestures are a stroke of at least 30 points, held for no more than a second. The right button and control-click always open the contextual menu, so they cannot be assigned." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each action can have several triggers. Drag gestures are a stroke of at least 30 points, held for no more than a second. The right button and control-click always open the contextual menu, so they cannot be assigned."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1つの操作に複数のトリガーを割り当てられます。ドラッグジェスチャーは、30ポイント以上を1秒以内に動かしたときに成立します。右ボタンとcontrol+クリックは常にコンテキストメニューを開くため、割り当てられません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each opens a window listing what qooViewer has saved, so you can pick what you no longer need and delete it. The files themselves are never touched." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each opens a window listing what qooViewer has saved, so you can pick what you no longer need and delete it. The files themselves are never touched."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どちらも、qooViewer が保存している内容を一覧するウインドウを開きます。\n不要になったものを選んで削除できます。ファイルそのものには手を触れません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each time you move to another folder, the tree on the left opens down to that folder and selects it. Folders you opened before stay open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each time you move to another folder, the tree on the left opens down to that folder and selects it. Folders you opened before stay open."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "別のフォルダへ移動するたびに、左のツリーをそのフォルダまで開いて選びます。それまでに開いていたフォルダは開いたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
