    "In step 2, “Automatic” reads a book with this rule set when the book meets both ① and ② below. A book that no rule set takes, or that more than one takes, is not decided — and then “Automatic” cannot be chosen." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In step 2, “Automatic” reads a book with this rule set when the book meets both ① and ② below. A book that no rule set takes, or that more than one takes, is not decided — and then “Automatic” cannot be chosen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "段 2 の「自動」は、下の ① と ② を両方満たす本を、このルールセットで読みます。どのルールセットにも当たらない本や、2 つ以上に当たって絞れない本は決まらず、そのときは「自動」を選べません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
