    "In the page list, decodes the preview image of every thumbnail on screen in advance so it appears immediately. Uses more memory and CPU. Has no effect while previews are turned off in Appearance ▸ Page List." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the page list, decodes the preview image of every thumbnail on screen in advance so it appears immediately. Uses more memory and CPU. Has no effect while previews are turned off in Appearance ▸ Page List."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ページ一覧で、画面に見えているサムネイルの拡大プレビュー用の画像をあらかじめデコードしておき、プレビューを即座に表示します。\nそのぶんメモリとCPUを使います。\n「外観」▸「ページ一覧」で拡大プレビューをOFFにしている間は効きません。"
