    "Memory" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メモリ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory not accounted for by the page-image and thumbnail caches of the book in this window. Includes the app itself, other open books, and anything waiting to be returned to the system. Shown as — when the system has compressed the caches below their nominal size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory not accounted for by the page-image and thumbnail caches of the book in this window. Includes the app itself, other open books, and anything waiting to be returned to the system. Shown as — when the system has compressed the caches below their nominal size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このウインドウの本のページ画像・サムネイルのキャッシュでは説明できないメモリです。アプリ本体、他に開いている本、システムへ返却待ちの領域を含みます。システムがキャッシュを名目上の大きさより小さく圧縮しているときは「—」になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Memory the 7z library keeps between page reads so that the next page of a solid block can continue from where the last one ended (and a few pages back can be re-read without starting the block over): the LZMA dictionary of that block, whose size is chosen when the archive is made (usually 16–64 MB), plus small buffers. It is released when the book is closed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Memory the 7z library keeps between page reads so that the next page of a solid block can continue from where the last one ended (and a few pages back can be re-read without starting the block over): the LZMA dictionary of that block, whose size is chosen when the archive is made (usually 16–64 MB), plus small buffers. It is released when the book is closed."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "7z のライブラリがページの読み取りの合間にも持ち続けているメモリです。ソリッドブロックの次のページを前回の続きから読む(数ページ戻るぶんはブロックを先頭から展開し直さずに済ませる)ために、そのブロックの LZMA 辞書(大きさは書庫を作るときに決まり、ふつう 16〜64MB)と小さなバッファを保持します。\n本を閉じると解放されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
