            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起動時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a folder is chosen, exporting from the right-click menu asks nothing and writes straight to it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once a folder is chosen, exporting from the right-click menu asks nothing and writes straight to it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダを決めておくと、右クリックからの書き出しは何も尋ねずにそのフォルダへ書き出します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One cell per page across the “Pages to preload on each side” range, laid out in reading order around the pages on screen (two cells in two-page spreads). Every cell filled means preloading is keeping up; a gap means that page is not in memory yet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One cell per page across the “Pages to preload on each side” range, laid out in reading order around the pages on screen (two cells in two-page spreads). Every cell filled means preloading is keeping up; a gap means that page is not in memory yet."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "環境設定「前後に先読みするページ数」の範囲を、いま表示しているページ(見開きなら2マス)を挟んで1マス1ページで並べています。並びは読み方向に合わせてあります。すべてのマスが塗られていれば先読みは追いついています。欠けたマスは、そのページがまだメモリにありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One character" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One character"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One image per book, as a zip file named after each book. Only books whose collection cover is an image you chose are included. Reading one back matches each image to a book by its file name, and shows you the result before importing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One image per book, as a zip file named after each book. Only books whose collection cover is an image you chose are included. Reading one back matches each image to a book by its file name, and shows you the result before importing."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本1冊につき1枚の画像を、その本の名前を付けてzipファイルにまとめます。対象は、コレクション表紙に画像を指定した本だけです。読み込むときは、中の画像をファイル名で本と結び付け、結果を確かめてから取り込めます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One JPEG per collection holding the covers shown on its tile, so Home draws each tile from a single image instead of reading every cover separately. Rebuilt from the collection covers whenever it is missing, and kept under the limit shown, oldest first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One JPEG per collection holding the covers shown on its tile, so Home draws each tile from a single image instead of reading every cover separately. Rebuilt from the collection covers whenever it is missing, and kept under the limit shown, oldest first."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コレクション1つにつき1枚のJPEG。そのタイルに並ぶカバーを1枚に焼いてあり、ホームはカバーを1枚ずつ読む代わりにこれを描きます。無くなってもコレクションのカバーから作り直せるキャッシュで、上限を超えたら古いものから捨てます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One series for the whole magazine" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One series for the whole magazine"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "雑誌全体で 1 つのシリーズにする"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One series per year" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One series per year"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 年ぶんごとのシリーズにする"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One small JPEG per book registered in a collection, extracted once when the book is added. Not a cache: deleting it means re-reading every registered book, so there is no size limit and nothing is evicted. It goes away with the collection, the book’s entry, or “Delete All Data”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One small JPEG per book registered in a collection, extracted once when the book is added. Not a cache: deleting it means re-reading every registered book, so there is no size limit and nothing is evicted. It goes away with the collection, the book’s entry, or “Delete All Data”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コレクションに登録した本1冊につき1枚の小さなJPEG。登録したときに1回だけ抽出します。キャッシュではありません ―― 消すと登録してある本を全冊読み直すことになるため、上限も自動削除もありません。コレクション・その本の登録・「すべてのデータを削除」と一緒に消えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only books whose collection cover is an image you chose are included. Covers taken from a page of the book can always be made again from the book itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only books whose collection cover is an image you chose are included. Covers taken from a page of the book can always be made again from the book itself."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "対象は、コレクション表紙に画像を指定した本だけです。本のページから取った表紙は、その本さえあればいつでも作り直せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only folders in Favorite Locations, or folders inside them, can be targets. Folders on network volumes can’t be used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only folders in Favorite Locations, or folders inside them, can be targets. Folders on network volumes can’t be used."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "対象にできるのは、よく使う項目とその中のフォルダだけです。ネットワーク上のフォルダは使えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the conditions are deleted. The books themselves and their saved data are not affected." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the conditions are deleted. The books themselves and their saved data are not affected."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削除するのは条件だけです。本そのものと保存データは変わりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the settings on this screen go back. Everything else you changed stays." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
