    },
    "Shown before the title of private windows. Leave it empty to show nothing, for example when a title bar color already tells them apart. You can use emoji." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shown before the title of private windows. Leave it empty to show nothing, for example when a title bar color already tells them apart. You can use emoji."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シークレットウインドウのタイトルの前に付ける文字です。空にすると何も付けません(タイトルバーの色で見分けられる場合など)。絵文字も使えます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shown in the File menu's Open Recent and in the side panel's History mode." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shown in the File menu's Open Recent and in the side panel's History mode."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルメニューの「最近開いた本」と、サイドパネルの「履歴」に表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows a frame from each video in icon view, made by Quick Look. While qooViewer is open, thumbnails for the videos in your favorite locations and their subfolders are also made in the background, so they appear right away. Some formats, such as MKV, need a Quick Look extension from another app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows a frame from each video in icon view, made by Quick Look. While qooViewer is open, thumbnails for the videos in your favorite locations and their subfolders are also made in the background, so they appear right away. Some formats, such as MKV, need a Quick Look extension from another app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アイコン表示で、動画の中の 1 コマを Quick Look で作って表示します。qooViewer を開いている間は、よく使う項目とそのサブフォルダにある動画のサムネイルも裏で作っておくので、すぐに表示されます。MKV など一部の形式は、ほかのアプリの Quick Look 機能拡張が必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows a panel for browsing folders and the current book's contents. When off, the panel and its View menu options are unavailable." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows a panel for browsing folders and the current book's contents. When off, the panel and its View menu options are unavailable."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダや、開いている本の中身を閲覧できるパネルを表示します。\nオフにすると、パネルと表示メニューの関連項目が利用できなくなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows only the books whose file names matched no file name format of their rule set. Right-click them to parse them again with another rule set" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows only the books whose file names matched no file name format of their rule set. Right-click them to parse them again with another rule set"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイル名がルールセットのどのファイル名フォーマットとも合致しなかった本だけを表示します。右クリックで別のルールセットで読み直せます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows only the books whose file names matched no format of their rule set. Right-click them to parse them again with another rule set" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows only the books whose file names matched no format of their rule set. Right-click them to parse them again with another rule set"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイル名がルールセットのどの型にも合わなかった本だけを表示します。右クリックで別のルールセットで読み直せます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the bookshelf — libraries and collections — on the Home screen. When off, Home shows only the other features you have on (or, with all of them off, the original welcome screen), the library and collection items disappear from the menus, context menus and the side panel, and the background work that exists only for libraries stops: checking that registered books are still there, making covers, and watching auto-add folders. Your libraries and collections are kept and come back when you turn this on again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the bookshelf — libraries and collections — on the Home screen. When off, Home shows only the other features you have on (or, with all of them off, the original welcome screen), the library and collection items disappear from the menus, context menus and the side panel, and the background work that exists only for libraries stops: checking that registered books are still there, making covers, and watching auto-add folders. Your libraries and collections are kept and come back when you turn this on again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ホームに本棚(ライブラリとコレクション)を表示します。オフにすると、ホームはほかにオンにしている機能だけになり(すべてオフなら以前のウェルカム画面)、メニュー・右クリックメニュー・サイドパネルからライブラリとコレクションの項目が消え、ライブラリのためだけの裏の処理(登録した本があるかの確認・表紙の作成・自動登録フォルダの監視)が止まります。ライブラリとコレクションは消えず、オンに戻せば元どおり表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the file browser on the Home screen. When off, the file browser and its items — including Show in File Browser — disappear from Home, the menus and context menus, and the background work that exists only for it stops: Auto Rename and making video thumbnails ahead of time. The top bar shows Open Book… and Open from History in its place. Your favorite locations, Auto Rename rules and thumbnail cache are kept. With Smart Library and Libraries also off, Home shows the original welcome screen: an Open button and your recent books." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the file browser on the Home screen. When off, the file browser and its items — including Show in File Browser — disappear from Home, the menus and context menus, and the background work that exists only for it stops: Auto Rename and making video thumbnails ahead of time. The top bar shows Open Book… and Open from History in its place. Your favorite locations, Auto Rename rules and thumbnail cache are kept. With Smart Library and Libraries also off, Home shows the original welcome screen: an Open button and your recent books."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ホームにファイルブラウザを表示します。オフにすると、ホーム・メニュー・右クリックメニューからファイルブラウザとその項目(「ファイルブラウザで開く」を含む)が消え、ファイルブラウザのためだけの裏の処理(自動リネーム・動画のサムネイルの先回り作成)が止まります。帯の左端には代わりに「本を開く…」と「履歴から開く」が出ます。よく使う項目・自動リネームの規則・サムネイルのキャッシュは消えません。スマートライブラリとライブラリもオフにすると、ホームは「開く…」ボタンと最近開いた本だけの、以前のウェルカム画面になります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the smart library on the Home screen: the books in the folders you choose, gathered by conditions and grouped by series or author. When off, it disappears from Home and the Home menu, and Edit Metadata no longer looks through its target folders. Your target folders and smart collections are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shows the smart library on the Home screen: the books in the folders you choose, gathered by conditions and grouped by series or author. When off, it disappears from Home and the Home menu, and Edit Metadata no longer looks through its target folders. Your target folders and smart collections are kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ホーム画面にスマートライブラリを表示します。選んだフォルダの中の本を、条件で集めたり、シリーズや著者でまとめたりできます。オフにすると、ホーム画面と「ホーム」メニューから消え、「メタデータの編集」も対象フォルダの中を探さなくなります。対象フォルダとスマートコレクションは残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
