    "Sorts by name the way Finder does: digits compare as numbers, and letter case and symbols follow the system's collation. When off, names are compared by character code instead, as in earlier versions, so every name starting with an uppercase letter comes before every name starting with a lowercase one. Open books and lists reorder right away. Books you have given a layout keep the order that layout was made for, because which pages pair into a spread depends on it; to make such a book follow the new order, use Reset Page Order in the Bookmarks & Layout window." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sorts by name the way Finder does: digits compare as numbers, and letter case and symbols follow the system's collation. When off, names are compared by character code instead, as in earlier versions, so every name starting with an uppercase letter comes before every name starting with a lowercase one. Open books and lists reorder right away. Books you have given a layout keep the order that layout was made for, because which pages pair into a spread depends on it; to make such a book follow the new order, use Reset Page Order in the Bookmarks & Layout window."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Finderと同じ名前順で並べます。数字は数値として比べ、大文字小文字や記号もシステムの照合順序に従います。\nOFFにすると、以前のバージョンと同じ文字コード順になります。大文字で始まる名前が、小文字で始まる名前よりすべて先に来ます。\n開いている本も一覧も、その場で並び替わります。レイアウトを設定した本だけは、そのレイアウトを作ったときの並びのままです(どのページが見開きで組になるかは並び順で決まるため)。新しい並びに合わせたい本は、「ブックマーク・レイアウトの編集」ウインドウの「ページ順を初期化する」で1冊ずつ合わせられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
