    "Subfolders in the tree on the left are sorted by the same column and direction as the items on the right. Volumes, Home Folder and your favorite locations keep their order. When this is off, subfolders are sorted by name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subfolders in the tree on the left are sorted by the same column and direction as the items on the right. Volumes, Home Folder and your favorite locations keep their order. When this is off, subfolders are sorted by name."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左のツリーのサブフォルダを、右の一覧と同じ基準・向きで並べます。ボリューム・ホームフォルダ・よく使う項目の並びは変わりません。オフのときは、サブフォルダを名前順に並べます。"
