    },
    "The characters that split the authors read from a name. A format can set its own instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The characters that split the authors read from a name. A format can set its own instead."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "名前から読んだ著者を分ける文字です。フォーマットごとに別の区切りを決めることもできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The closest format is the one on line %1$lld (%2$@); it looked for the next fixed character at character %3$lld — the marked part." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The closest format is the one on line %1$lld (%2$@); it looked for the next fixed character at character %3$lld — the marked part."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いちばん近いのは %1$lld 行目のフォーマット (%2$@) です。%3$lld 文字目にあるはずの固定文字が見つかりませんでした —— 印の部分です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The closest is the format on line %1$lld; it looked for the next fixed character at character %2$lld and did not find it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The closest is the format on line %1$lld; it looked for the next fixed character at character %2$lld and did not find it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いちばん近いのは %1$lld 行目のフォーマットです。%2$lld 文字目にあるはずの固定文字が見つかりませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The color only shows once Color Strength is above 0%. Picking a color while it is 0% raises it for you, so you can see what you chose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The color only shows once Color Strength is above 0%. Picking a color while it is 0% raises it for you, so you can see what you chose."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "色は「背景色の濃さ」を0%より上げるまで見た目に現れません。\n0%のまま色を選んだ場合は、選んだ色が分かるように濃さを自動で少し上げます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cover can't be changed in a private window, because it would have to be saved." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The cover can't be changed in a private window, because it would have to be saved."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シークレットウインドウでは、カバー画像を変更できません(指定を保存する必要があるためです)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The decoded page images kept in memory have stayed above the “Page images kept in memory” setting for several seconds. The cache should evict older pages as soon as the limit is reached." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The decoded page images kept in memory have stayed above the “Page images kept in memory” setting for several seconds. The cache should evict older pages as soon as the limit is reached."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メモリに残しているページ画像が、環境設定「メモリに残しておくページ画像」の上限を数秒以上超えたままです。本来は上限に達した時点で古いページから削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The destination volume doesn't have enough free space (at least 1.2× the total size of the selected books is required). Choose a different destination, or select fewer books." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The destination volume doesn't have enough free space (at least 1.2× the total size of the selected books is required). Choose a different destination, or select fewer books."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存先ボリュームの空き容量が不足しています(選択した本の合計サイズの1.2倍以上が必要です)。別の保存先を選ぶか、選択する本を減らしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The enlarged thumbnails kept in memory have stayed above their built-in limit for several seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The enlarged thumbnails kept in memory have stayed above their built-in limit for several seconds."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拡大サムネイルが、固定の上限を数秒以上超えたままです。"
