            "value" : "「.」と「..」はシステムが使う名前のため使えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new name would begin with a dot “.”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The new name would begin with a dot “.”."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新しい名前が「.」(ドット)で始まってしまいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The numerals in the list (弐, 参, 四 …) are read as the volume with no word before and no unit after, as long as a space, the end of the name, or a separator follows. “X 四季” is not read" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The numerals in the list (弐, 参, 四 …) are read as the volume with no word before and no unit after, as long as a space, the end of the name, or a separator follows. “X 四季” is not read"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一覧の漢数字(弐・参・四 …)は、前に語が無く後ろに単位が無くても、空白・名前の終わり・区切りが続けば巻として読みます。「X 四季」は読みません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The operation couldn’t be completed for “%1$@”. %2$@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The operation couldn’t be completed for “%1$@”. %2$@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」の操作を完了できませんでした。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order, names and image sizes of the pages of books you have opened, so that a book opens without scanning its archive again. Kept under 50 MB, oldest first. Deleting it only means the next open of a book scans it again. Nothing is written for books opened in a private window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The order, names and image sizes of the pages of books you have opened, so that a book opens without scanning its archive again. Kept under 50 MB, oldest first. Deleting it only means the next open of a book scans it again. Nothing is written for books opened in a private window."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開いた本のページの並び順・ファイル名・画像の寸法です。次に開くときに書庫を走査し直さずに済ませるために残しています。\n合計50MBを上限に、古いものから削除されます。\n削除しても、次にその本を開くときに走査し直すだけです。\nシークレットウインドウで開いた本については何も書きません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order, names and image sizes of the pages of books you have opened, so that a book opens without scanning its archive again. Kept under the limit shown, oldest first; you can delete it in Settings ▸ Cache. Nothing is written for books opened in a private window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The order, names and image sizes of the pages of books you have opened, so that a book opens without scanning its archive again. Kept under the limit shown, oldest first; you can delete it in Settings ▸ Cache. Nothing is written for books opened in a private window."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開いた本のページの並び順・ファイル名・画像の寸法です。次に開くときに書庫を走査し直さずに済ませるために残しています。表示の上限に収まるよう古いものから削除され、環境設定「キャッシュ」から削除できます。シークレットウインドウで開いた本については何も書きません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original “%1$@” couldn’t be put back. It was kept as the hidden item “%2$@” in the same folder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original “%1$@” couldn’t be put back. It was kept as the hidden item “%2$@” in the same folder."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "元の「%1$@」を戻せませんでした。同じフォルダの中に、隠し項目「%2$@」として残っています。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original file or folder could not be found." : {
      "localizations" : {
