          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "元のファイル/フォルダが見つかりませんでした。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original folder no longer exists." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original folder no longer exists."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "元のフォルダがもうありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page number under the pointer is always shown. When file names are hidden, so is the location line above thumbnails that live in a folder inside the book." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The page number under the pointer is always shown. When file names are hidden, so is the location line above thumbnails that live in a folder inside the book."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カーソル位置のページ番号は、この設定に関わらず常に表示されます。ファイル名を表示しないときは、書庫の中のフォルダにある画像でサムネイルの上に出る場所の行も表示されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The part left after the series name is tried **from the top down**, and the first way of reading that can make sense of it settles the volume. Turning one off is how you stop it reading something it should not." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The part left after the series name is tried **from the top down**, and the first way of reading that can make sense of it settles the volume. Turning one off is how you stop it reading something it should not."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "シリーズ名より後ろに残った部分を、**上から順に**試し、最初に読めた読み方で巻数を決めます。読んでほしくない書き方は、その読み方を切ってください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The path of “%1$@” would be too long at the destination (%2$lld bytes; the limit is %3$lld)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The path of “%1$@” would be too long at the destination (%2$lld bytes; the limit is %3$lld)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」を置くと、移動先でのパスが長すぎます(%2$lld バイト。上限は %3$lld バイト)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pictures of books, images, videos and folders in the file browser's icon view are kept on your startup disk, so a folder you have already viewed shows them right away instead of reading every book again. Turning this off deletes them right away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The pictures of books, images, videos and folders in the file browser's icon view are kept on your startup disk, so a folder you have already viewed shows them right away instead of reading every book again. Turning this off deletes them right away."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルブラウザのアイコン表示に出す本・画像・動画・フォルダの絵を起動ディスクに保存しておき、一度表示したフォルダでは本を読み直さずにすぐ出します。オフにすると、保存してある絵はすぐに削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The progress-bar thumbnails kept in memory have stayed above their built-in limit for several seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The progress-bar thumbnails kept in memory have stayed above their built-in limit for several seconds."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "プログレスバー用のサムネイルが、固定の上限を数秒以上超えたままです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The registered metadata of %lld books in the excluded folders is deleted. The books themselves are not deleted. This can't be undone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The registered metadata of %lld books in the excluded folders is deleted. The books themselves are not deleted. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "除外フォルダにある %lld 冊の登録済みのメタデータを削除します。本そのものは削除しません。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The registered metadata of %lld books is deleted and they go back to the values read from the file names. Locked books are left alone. You can undo this with Undo." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The registered metadata of %lld books is deleted and they go back to the values read from the file names. Locked books are left alone. You can undo this with Undo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 冊の登録したメタデータを削除し、ファイル名から読んだ値に戻します。ロックした本はそのままです。「取り消す」で元に戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rule sets you saved under a name of your own are deleted, and the bundled ones go back to their bundled contents." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The rule sets you saved under a name of your own are deleted, and the bundled ones go back to their bundled contents."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自分で名前をつけて保存したルールセットは削除され、標準のルールセットは標準の内容に戻ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The rules do not hold their words themselves; they point at a list here. One list can serve several rules, and what you add to it acts everywhere it is used." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The rules do not hold their words themselves; they point at a list here. One list can serve several rules, and what you add to it acts everywhere it is used."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "規則は語を自分で持たず、ここの一覧を指しています。1 つの一覧を複数の規則が使うことがあり、足した語は使っている所すべてで効きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same format appears twice" : {
