          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This creates a single zip file containing one image per book, named after the book's file or folder. Only books whose collection cover is an image you chose are included — covers taken from a page of the book can always be made again from the book itself."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本1冊につき1枚の画像を、その本のファイル名(フォルダ名)を付けて1つのzipファイルにまとめます。対象は、コレクション表紙に画像を指定した本だけです ―― 本のページから取った表紙は、その本さえあればいつでも作り直せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes all data qooViewer has saved, except folder access permissions. This cannot be undone, and qooViewer will quit immediately afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This deletes all data qooViewer has saved, except folder access permissions. This cannot be undone, and qooViewer will quit immediately afterward."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダのアクセス権を除く、qooViewerが保存したすべてのデータを削除します。この操作は取り消せません。実行後、qooViewerはただちに終了します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This entry isn't valid, so it will be ignored." : {
