          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the favorites, bookmarks, page layout settings, metadata, and reading history qooViewer has saved for this. The file itself is not touched. This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This permanently deletes the favorites, bookmarks, page layout settings, metadata, and reading history qooViewer has saved for this. The file itself is not touched. This cannot be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この本について qooViewer が保存しているお気に入り・ブックマーク・レイアウト設定・メタデータ・読書位置を完全に削除します。ファイル自体には触れません。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recalculates the layout of the entire book, based on the page (or spread) currently displayed. This cannot be undone." : {
