    "What happens when you double-click an image folder, or select it and press Return, in list or icon view. Open in the right-click menu does the other one, so both stay within reach. Folders that aren't books always open as folders, and the tree on the left isn't affected." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What happens when you double-click an image folder, or select it and press Return, in list or icon view. Open in the right-click menu does the other one, so both stay within reach. Folders that aren't books always open as folders, and the tree on the left isn't affected."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "リスト表示・アイコン表示で、画像フォルダをダブルクリックしたとき、または選んでリターンキーを押したときにすることです。右クリックの「開く」はもう一方をするので、どちらの開き方もすぐ使えます。本ではないフォルダは常にフォルダとして開き、左のツリーには影響しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
