    },
    "What to do with a book that carries no number at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What to do with a book that carries no number at all."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "番号がまったく書かれていない本が 1 冊だけあるとき、1 巻とみなすかどうか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you change on screen is kept as a **diff** laid over the bundled defaults. You can edit it here directly, or write it to a file and carry it elsewhere. If a word you added holds the name of one of your books, the written file holds it too." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you change on screen is kept as a **diff** laid over the bundled defaults. You can edit it here directly, or write it to a file and carry it elsewhere. If a word you added holds the name of one of your books, the written file holds it too."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画面で変更した内容は、標準の設定に重ねる**差分**として保存されます。ここで直接書き換えることも、ファイルに書き出して持ち運ぶこともできます。追加した語に蔵書の名前が含まれていれば、書き出したファイルにも含まれます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
