    "When “Automatic” chooses this rule set" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When “Automatic” chooses this rule set"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自動」でこのルールセットを選ぶ条件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a book has other archives inside it, each one is opened only when you reach it, and the most recently used ones are kept here. Larger values move between chapters faster; smaller values use less memory. An archive larger than this is written to a temporary file instead, and how much of that is kept follows this setting too. At 0, a temporary file is always used." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When a book has other archives inside it, each one is opened only when you reach it, and the most recently used ones are kept here. Larger values move between chapters faster; smaller values use less memory. An archive larger than this is written to a temporary file instead, and how much of that is kept follows this setting too. At 0, a temporary file is always used."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本の中にさらに書庫が入っている場合、その書庫はそこまで読み進めたときに初めて開き、最近使ったものをここに残しておきます。大きくするほど章をまたぐ移動が速くなり、小さくするほどメモリの使用量が減ります。これより大きい書庫は一時ファイルに書き出して開き、そちらをどれだけ残しておくかもこの設定に従います。0にすると常に一時ファイルを使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When books that would be grouped carry different @source values" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When books that would be grouped carry different @source values"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じまとまりになった本の原作(@source)が違うとき"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When both titles are made only of words found in the dictionary" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
