          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, hovering over the progress bar shows just the page number under the pointer, and no thumbnails are loaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, hovering over the progress bar shows just the page number under the pointer, and no thumbnails are loaded."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OFFにすると、プログレスバーにカーソルを合わせてもサムネイルは読み込まれず、カーソル位置のページ番号だけが表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, private windows look the same as normal windows. When you first turn it on, private windows start from a copy of the normal windows’ appearance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, private windows look the same as normal windows. When you first turn it on, private windows start from a copy of the normal windows’ appearance."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフの間は、シークレットウインドウもノーマルウインドウと同じ外観になります。初めてオンにしたときは、ノーマルウインドウの外観を写したところから始まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, the side panel does not appear while no book is open — it neither takes up space nor slides out when you move the pointer to the edge of the window with Hide Side Panel on. Open a book and the panel comes back." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the side panel does not appear while no book is open — it neither takes up space nor slides out when you move the pointer to the edge of the window with Hide Side Panel on. Open a book and the panel comes back."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると、本を開いていない間はサイドパネルが出てこなくなります。場所を取ることも、「サイドパネルを隠す」がオンのときにウインドウの端へカーソルを近づけて出てくることもありません。本を開けば元どおり表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When scrolling is not possible — that is, in Fit to Screen — the wheel always performs the action assigned to it in Mouse, whatever you choose here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When scrolling is not possible — that is, in Fit to Screen — the wheel always performs the action assigned to it in Mouse, whatever you choose here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スクロールできないとき(「画面内に収める」で表示しているとき)は、ここでの選択に関わらず、「マウス」でホイールに割り当てた操作を行います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Scrolling Is Possible" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Scrolling Is Possible"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スクロールできるとき"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the books of one series start with kanji numerals" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the books of one series start with kanji numerals"
