            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この容量を超えそうになると、最後に見てから最も時間が経った絵から順に削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the cache would grow past this size, the thumbnails you looked at longest ago are deleted first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the cache would grow past this size, the thumbnails you looked at longest ago are deleted first."
