            "value" : "ファイルブラウザを開いたとき"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the shared text is cut mid-word and ends in a particle. Also when one whole title is the head of another and the longer goes on in hiragana (“…です!!” and “…ですか?”)" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the shared text is cut mid-word and ends in a particle. Also when one whole title is the head of another and the longer goes on in hiragana (“…です!!” and “…ですか?”)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "語の途中で切れた共通部分が、助詞などで終わるとき。片方の題名全体がもう片方の頭と一致し、長いほうがそのままひらがなで続くときも(「…です!!」と「…ですか?」)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the shared text is cut mid-word and is all katakana or all kanji" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the shared text is cut mid-word and is all katakana or all kanji"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
